OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather grey start this
OL,6,Fmorning, with outbreaks of rain across
OL,7,FScotland and Northern Ireland. Largely
OL,8,Fdry for England and Wales with spells
OL,9,Fof hazy sunshine developing. Feeling
OL,10,Fwarm in the sunshine across the south,
OL,11,Fbut near average temperatures
OL,12,Felsewhere.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FRather cloudy with further
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain across northern
OL,16,Fareas, with the rain heaviest in
OL,17,Fwestern Scotland. Mostly dry further
OL,18,Fsouth with some clear spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
