OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FRemaining cloudy in the north
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain, turning
OL,7,Fheavier and more persistent later.
OL,8,FFurther south, hazy sunshine will
OL,9,Fdevelop, making it feel very warm and
OL,10,Fhumid.
